{"id": "141258", "name": "מטריצות מעבר וקואורדינטות בפולינומים R₃[x] – 3 סעיפים", "defaultgrade": 2, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "randvervectnonzero", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[0]),n))"}, {"name": "randhorvect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "matrix(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "dezero", "params": ["vec", "n", "k"], "body": "if (zeromatrixp(vec)) then randvervectnonzero(n,k) else vec"}, {"name": "dezerolst", "params": ["veclst", "k"], "body": "map(lambda([vec], dezero(vec, length(vec),k)), veclst)"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "collify", "params": ["M"], "body": "block([cols:[]],for i:1 thru length(transpose(M)) do(cols: endcons(col(M,i),cols)),cols)"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "inSpan", "params": ["veclst1", "veclst2"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst1)) = rank(matrify(append(veclst1,veclst2))))"}, {"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "block([poly:0], for i:0 thru (length(vect)-1) do(poly: poly + x^i*vect[i+1,1]),poly)"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly"], "body": "transpose(rest(coeff_list(x^n+poly,x),-1))"}, {"name": "alltrue", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "emptyp(delete(true,map(pred, lst)))"}, {"name": "leavefalses", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "delete(true,map(lambda([ex],if pred(ex) then true else ex), lst))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים בסיסים סדורים למרחב הפולינומים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 3}[x]\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[B_1 = (1,x,x^2,x^3)\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[B_2 = ({{CT:0}}, {{CT:1}}, {{CT:2}},{{CT:3}})\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את מטריצות המעבר</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([I]^{B_1}_{B_2}=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([I]^{B_2}_{B_1}=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:14px\">עבור הפולינום</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p(x)={{CT:4}}\\]</p><p>חשבו את וקטור הקואורדינטות</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([p(x)]_{B_2}=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> עמודות מטריצת המעבר הן וקטורי הקואורדינטות של הבסיס האחד לפי השני. את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_2\\)</span> קל לכתוב לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_1\\)</span> (פיתוח), ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_1\\)</span> לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_2\\)</span> — בהצבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x={{CT:5}}\\)</span>. בסוף כופלים את וקטור המקדמים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p\\)</span> במטריצה המתאימה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הכלל</b><br>העמודה ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(j\\)</span> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{C}_{D}\\)</span> היא וקטור הקואורדינטות לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> של הווקטור ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(j\\)</span> בבסיס <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span>. כך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^C_D\\,[p]_C=[p]_D\\)</span>. נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s={{CT:6}}\\)</span>, כך ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_2=(1,s,s^2,s^3)\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B_2}_{B_1}\\)</span></b><br>מפתחים כל פולינום של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_2\\)</span> לפי החזקות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 1,\\quad {{CT:1}},\\quad {{CT:2}}={{CT:7}},\\quad {{CT:3}}={{CT:8}} \\]</p>המקדמים (של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1,x,x^2,x^3\\)</span>, לפי הסדר) הם העמודות:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [I]^{B_2}_{B_1}={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B_1}_{B_2}\\)</span></b><br>צריך לכתוב את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1,x,x^2,x^3\\)</span> לפי החזקות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s\\)</span>. מכיוון ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x={{CT:5}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 1=1,\\quad x={{CT:10}},\\quad x^2={{CT:11}},\\quad x^3={{CT:12}} \\]</p>המקדמים (של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1,s,s^2,s^3\\)</span>) הם העמודות:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [I]^{B_1}_{B_2}={{CT:13}} \\]</p>זו ההופכית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B_2}_{B_1}\\)</span>, ואפשר לבדוק: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:13}}{{CT:9}}={{CT:14}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — וקטור הקואורדינטות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([p(x)]_{B_2}\\)</span></b><br>וקטור הקואורדינטות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p\\)</span> לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_1\\)</span> הוא וקטור המקדמים שלו:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [p(x)]_{B_1}={{CT:15}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [p(x)]_{B_2}=[I]^{B_1}_{B_2}\\,[p(x)]_{B_1}={{CT:13}}{{CT:15}}={{CT:16}} \\]</p>בדיקה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:17}}\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(s={{CT:6}}\\)</span> נותן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:18}}=p(x)\\)</span>. התשובה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [p(x)]_{B_2}={{CT:16}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt3]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 1, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 1, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 1, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": ".", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt3", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "goodsizeM(M):= is(length(M)=n and length(transpose(M))=n);\nbadsize: leavefalses(goodsizeM,[ans2,ans1]);\ngoodszrv: is(length(ans3)=n and length(transpose(ans3))=1);\nperfect: is([ans2,ans1,ans3]=[TMBE, TMEB, rvB]);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "badsize", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">חלק מהקלטים שהזנת אינם מטריצות בגודל המתאים: {@badsize@}.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "TMBE", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt3-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt3-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B_1}_{B_2}\\)</span> שגוי.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "TMEB", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt3-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt3-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B_2}_{B_1}\\)</span> שגוי.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodszrv", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt3-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt3-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הקלט שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([p(x)]_{B_2}\\)</span> אינו וקטור עמודה מהגודל המתאים.</div>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "rvB", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt3-5-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt3-5-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([p(x)]_{B_2}\\)</span> שגוי.</div>"}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "perfect", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-6-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-6-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["B", "E", "TMBE", "TMEB", "k", "n", "pS", "pm", "polyB", "randvect", "rvB", "xk"], "nvariants": 50}